{"kind": "web_lines", "number": 1, "end_line": 16, "text": "给高×的信（一九六四年三月十八日）\n中文马克思主义文库\n->\n毛泽东\n->\n1968年汉版《毛泽东思想万岁》\n071)\n给高×的信\n（一九六四年三月十八日）\n高×先生：\n寄书寄词，还有二信，均己收到，极为感谢，高文两册，我很爱读，肃此，敬颂吉安。\n毛泽东\n一九六四年三月十八日\n上一页\n目录\n下一页\n", "printed_page": null, "witness_id": "A-d5f5d3da638de742fbf4", "source_url": "https://www.marxists.org/chinese/maozedong/1968/5-071.htm", "source_raw_sha256": "800bffa590569b30aa68d4cbdf3b440ed421ba87f119d2b332148013a2c6b6ba", "edition_refs": [{"edition_id": "mia-1968", "volume": 5, "basis": "source_catalogue_not_print_collation"}], "source_text_sha256": "5dd2b1981b3eec7d2e463ad70fa691d57e53763a23acf8c96c73adbaecab2ff5", "text_chars": 150}
